intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le11ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you \u2026<br> I'd like to \u2026<br> Would you mind \u2026<br> Would ... be okay?<br> Would you mind if \u2026<br> I was wondering if \u2026<br> Could you \u2026<br> Do you think you could \u2026<br> Is there any chance you could ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, I'll \u2026<br> Sure, I'd be glad to \u2026<br> No, not at all.<br> Certainly.<br> Yes, of course.<br> I'll see what I can do.<br> I don't mind at all.<br> Of course we can \u2026<br> No problem.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can express an option with the phrases below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some people say that...<br> In my experience,\u2026<br> As far as I'm concerned,\u2026<br> Speaking for myself,\u2026<br> In my opinion,\u2026<br> Personally, I think\u2026<br> I'd say that\u2026<br> I believe that\u2026<br> What I mean is\u2026"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Personally, I think this is charming! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think the traffic is crazy here."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I'd say that this is the real Cairo."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "transportation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a way to move people or things from one place to another "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People in some cities use subways for transportation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about sightseeing in Cairo."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wagon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an open vehicle with wheels pulled by a donkey "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We rode in a wagon to the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cushion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a soft bag that is comfortable to sit on "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The large cushion made the wagon ride comfortable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chaotic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "confusing and out of order  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The traffic in the city was  chaotic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "confusing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult to understand "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The map was confusing, so we got lost."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quieter "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without many people or much noise or activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective in comparative form)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After the market closed the streets were quieter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 sights to go in your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Research them online or using other resources."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write what you want to say about each place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give your opinion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to their sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about places in my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give my opinion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read aloud to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le11ob09re2img07.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Hello Miss. I am Mohammed for your city tour.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Nice to meet you. Is this our transportation?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span> : Yes. Many people sightsee in open wagons like these.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Personally, I think this is charming! Can you help me with these cushions?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Of course.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Others go by bus or subway. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: In my opinion, they can't experience the city.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Walking is good too.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Speaking for myself, the city is chaotic and confusing. Oh, can we stop here?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>. No problem, Miss.", "id": 2, "time": "20000", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img09.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think the traffic is crazy here. Could you go down quieter roads?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: I'll see what I can do. Here. This is better. We can see where people live.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd say that this is the real Cairo.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Yes,  Miss, it is.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mohammed, would you take me to the El-Azmek Garden?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: I'd be glad to, Miss.<br>", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img09.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about transportation and travel."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can make and respond to requests."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can express opinions with varying degree of certainty"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you go on tours in a new city?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you prefer walking or using public transport? Why?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "fre